[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 300.31, "timestamp": "00:05:00", "text": "加入我。好吧，好像我的世界很简单似的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 302.23, "timestamp": "00:05:02", "text": "而且这款游戏显然是这样的，哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 304.629, "timestamp": "00:05:04", "text": "你太菜了，没资格加入这家伙的群。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 314.469, "timestamp": "00:05:14", "text": "好吧。我的难度不算高。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 316.39, "timestamp": "00:05:16", "text": "所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 330.469, "timestamp": "00:05:30", "text": "好的。我收下这个，稍等片刻。让"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 332.71, "timestamp": "00:05:32", "text": "我做我的，是的。是的。一秒钟。让我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 334.23, "timestamp": "00:05:34", "text": "做“不，不，不”。不想做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 336.31, "timestamp": "00:05:36", "text": "任何事物。请过来一下。是的。一"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 339.83, "timestamp": "00:05:39", "text": "第二。让我完善我的技能。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 340.99, "timestamp": "00:05:40", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 344.95, "timestamp": "00:05:44", "text": "等等，其实你随时随地都可以做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 347.909, "timestamp": "00:05:47", "text": "是的，我有一些技能。我没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 350.15, "timestamp": "00:05:50", "text": "技能。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 355.95, "timestamp": "00:05:55", "text": "[音乐]"}]